 a pederast, Walter?","intensity":0.45},{"start":117.05353,"end":118.93173499999999,"speaker":"walter","text":"Shut the fuck up, Donny.","intensity":0.7},{"start":120.68295,"end":123.13609100000001,"speaker":"walter","text":"So, how much did they give you?","intensity":0.7},{"start":123.32144,"end":124.82959,"speaker":"dude","text":"Twenty grand, man.","intensity":0.45},{"start":124.98958999999999,"end":127.35943999999999,"speaker":"dude","text":"And, of course, I still get to keep the rug.","intensity":0.45},{"start":127.51943999999999,"end":128.72179,"speaker":"walter","text":"Just for making the handoff?","intensity":0.7},{"start":128.88179,"end":131.48289,"speaker":"dude","text":"Yeah, they gave, uh, Dude a beeper.","intensity":0.45},{"start":131.86329,"end":133.49346,"speaker":"dude","text":"So, whenever these guys call...","intensity":0.45},{"start":133.65346,"end":135.00768000000002,"speaker":"donny","text":"What if it's during a game?","intensity":0.45},{"start":135.16768000000002,"end":137.94420000000002,"speaker":"dude","text":"Oh, I told them, uh, if it was during league play.","intensity":0.45},{"start":138.10420000000002,"end":139.35386000000003,"speaker":"donny","text":"What's during league play?","intensity":0.45},{"start":139.51386000000002,"end":142.77301000000003,"speaker":"walter","text":"Life does not stop and start at your convenience,","intensity":0.7},{"start":142.93301000000002,"end":144.56611000000004,"speaker":"walter","text":"you miserable piece of shit.","intensity":0.7},{"start":144.72611000000003,"end":145.61743,"speaker":"dude","text":"I-I figure...","intensity":0.45},{"start":145.77743,"end":147.17182000000003,"speaker":"donny","text":"What's wrong with Walter, dude?","intensity":0.45},{"start":147.33182000000002,"end":149.21916800000008,"speaker":"dude","text":"Uh, I figure it's easy money, you know.","intensity":0.45},{"start":149.37916800000008,"end":150.22071800000006,"speaker":"dude","text":"It's all pretty harmless.","intensity":0.45},{"start":150.38071800000006,"end":152.21456800000004,"speaker":"dude","text":"She probably kidnapped herself.","intensity":0.45},{"start":152.37456800000004,"end":152.58764600000003,"speaker":"walter","text":"Huh?","intensity":0.7},{"start":152.74764600000003,"end":153.49027880000003,"speaker":"dude","text":"Oh.","intensity":0.45},{"start":153.65027880000002,"end":154.74421880000003,"speaker":"walter","text":"What do you mean, dude?","intensity":0.7},{"start":154.90421880000002,"end":157.04286880000004,"speaker":"dude","text":"Rug pee-ers did not do this.","intensity":0.45},{"start":157.20286880000003,"end":158.12471880000004,"speaker":"dude","text":"Look at it.","intensity":0.45},{"start":158.28471880000004,"end":161.72259880000004,"speaker":"dude","text":"A young trophy wife marries this guy for his money.","intensity":0.45},{"start":161.88259880000004,"end":164.60767880000006,"speaker":"dude","text":"She figures that he isn't giving her enough, you know.","intensity":0.45},{"start":164.76767880000006,"end":167.05808880000004,"speaker":"dude","text":"She owes money all over town.","intensity":0.45},{"start":167.21808880000003,"end":168.85592240000003,"speaker":"walter","text":"That fucking bitch.","intensity":0.7},{"start":169.01592240000002,"end":171.85792000000004,"speaker":"dude","text":"It's all goddamn fake, man.","intensity":0.45},{"start":172.01792000000003,"end":173.81573350000002,"speaker":"dude","text":"It's like Lenin said.","intensity":0.45},{"start":173.97573350000002,"end":178.09415540000003,"speaker":"dude","text":"You look for the person who will benefit and, you know.","intensity":0.45},{"start":178.25415540000003,"end":178.9666554,"speaker":"donny","text":"I am the walrus?","intensity":0.45},{"start":179.1266554,"end":181.2000734,"speaker":"dude","text":"You know, you'll, you know what I'm trying to say.","intensity":0.45},{"start":181.3600734,"end":182.8427584,"speaker":"donny","text":"I am the walrus.","intensity":0.45},{"start":183.0027